				"descBody": {
					"type": "text",
					"text": "This 4D application demonstrates a  cross-device session sharing. After sharing the session, a web page displays a challenge number and a QR code; scanning it on a phone restores the SAME 4D session through a one-time token ($4DSID). Tapping the matching number grants the \"verified_user\" privilege, which then unlocks a privilege-gated photo upload.",
